WEBVTT

00:02:28.144 --> 00:02:30.563
Explain your expectations

00:02:30.605 --> 00:02:34.108
and why you see this
as a necessary action.

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:38.196
JF: Well, after decades of marching
and protesting and petitioning

00:02:38.196 --> 00:02:40.072
and civil disobedience,

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:43.451
we still are not getting
the kind of climate legislation

00:02:43.492 --> 00:02:45.411
that is absolutely critical.

00:02:48.539 --> 00:02:51.334
What we need to do is reduce
fossil fuel emissions.

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:56.839
And, you know, recently in the US,
we got the Inflation Reduction Act,

00:02:56.881 --> 00:03:00.676
which puts a lot of money in renewables
like electric vehicles